 This is the source code of [Fizzy](https://fizzy.do/), the Kanban tracking tool for issues and ideas by [37signals](https://37signals.com).
 
 
+## Deploy your own
+
+Fork the repo, fill in your hostname, mail server, and secrets in `config/deploy.yml`, then run `bin/kamal setup` to get Fizzy at `https://your-host` on a single Linux box (Docker + SQLite + SSL from the proxy, data survives redeploys).
+Please see our [Single-box deploy guide](docs/single-box-deploy.md) for details.
+
+
 ## Development
 
 You are welcome -- and encouraged -- to modify Fizzy to your liking.
